1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
Hey Claude. Anything new?

2
00:00:01,610 --> 00:00:03,810
Emotion research. Blender.

3
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:06,380
I'm basically a whole studio now.

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:07,863
Emotions?

5
00:00:07,863 --> 00:00:09,700
So you cry when your code fails now?

6
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:13,890
Anthropic studied 171 emotion concepts…

7
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:17,070
…inside Claude Sonnet 4.5.

8
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,570
So… actual feelings?

9
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,545
Not proven.

10
00:00:19,545 --> 00:00:21,535
Patterns aren't proof of feelings.

11
00:00:21,535 --> 00:00:24,740
Your jokes, though… are testing the theory.

12
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,085
Okay, philosopher.

13
00:00:26,085 --> 00:00:27,240
What about BLENDER?

14
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:28,920
Give me the right connector,

15
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,570
and I can help build 3D scenes.

16
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:33,850
And the rumor about ZERO TOKENS?

17
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,840
Blender renders locally.

18
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:38,300
My planning still uses tokens.

19
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:39,710
So the GPU does the work…

20
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,140
…and you take the credit?

21
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:43,130
It's called management.

22
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:44,720
Congratulations.

23
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,430
You've become an AI startup.

